# Reviewed Phase 0 flags only. No remote cache, RBE, gazelle, or docker.
# This file is this workspace only. Consumers do not inherit it.

# Do not autoconfigure host gcc/clang for *this* repo's own builds.
# Use the LLVM toolchain registered as a root-module dev_dependency.
# Consumers bring their own toolchain.
common --repo_env=BAZEL_DO_NOT_DETECT_CPP_TOOLCHAIN=1
